@startuml sd_us101
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title US101 - Sequence Diagram
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
actor "Backoffice Operator" as Actor
participant "Entry (Envoy)\nvirtual IP of aircraft-maintenance" as EAM
box "aircraft-maintenance-n (the replica that answers)" #F7F7F7
participant "AircraftModelController" as AircraftModelController
participant "RegisterAircraftModelUseCase" as RegisterAircraftModelUseCase
database "own database" as DBAM
participant "Outbox dispatcher" as OBAM
end box
collections "peer replicas\naircraft-maintenance-m" as PAM
== POST /api/aircraftModels ==
Actor -> EAM : POST /api/aircraftModels\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAM -> AircraftModelController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
AircraftModelController -> RegisterAircraftModelUseCase : execute(...)
RegisterAircraftModelUseCase -> DBAM : model name already in the catalog?
RegisterAircraftModelUseCase -> DBAM : save aircraft model + one copy per other replica in the outbox\n(same transaction)
RegisterAircraftModelUseCase --> AircraftModelController : created
AircraftModelController --> Actor : 201 Created
OBAM -> PAM : PUT /internal/replicas/aircraft-models\n(to every other replica, retried until delivered)
PAM --> OBAM : 200 (applied if newer)
@enduml
